meta {
	name: 04_UpdatePendingRequest
	seq: 4
}

docs {
	Scenario: The requester changes the rights asked for in a pending request

		Given the approver has no pending request from the requester for the resource
		And the approver can delegate at least two rights on the resource
		When the requester asks for one right on the resource through v2
		And the requester asks for another right in a new request, the request fails with 409 naming the pending request
		And the requester changes the pending request to ask for the other right instead
		And the requester tries to change the request to ask for no rights, the change fails
		Then the approver sees the pending request with the other right
		Finally the approver rejects the request to clean up
}
